# Task 3 P2 fix review package

Scope is the delta against the already implemented pre-fix Task 3 source, not HEAD. Only `src/AtomUI.Generator/Localization/LanguageTagsSourceWriter.cs` changed in this fix. The immutable task-start writer copy and SHA-256 values identify both states. Existing Task 3 source/fixture inventory stays at 11 files.

The writer canonicalizes only the emitted trusted getter literal using the source-linked BCP47 parser. Data model, accepted-input/identifier/duplicate diagnostics, definition switch cases, module helper, snapshot matcher, registry and runtime source are unchanged. Guard failure is an internal invariant check: the existing accepted language/script/region grammar is a subset of the build parser's grammar. No fallback mapping or runtime/public API was added.

RED/GREEN: temporary emitted-assembly acceptance used unchanged runtime parser source, compared 13 ordinary/alias/script/region/preferred-pair rows, verified build/runtime parser equality and existing diagnostics. Valid RED 6 getter mismatches (1 fail/1 pass); GREEN 2/2. Temporary tests removed; final exact LanguageTagsGeneratorTests 12/12, diffcheck passed. No timings/runtime tests/full suite repeated. Source frozen; build/test ownership released. Raw fix logs are retained beside this package; setup error is clearly separated from valid RED.

