- Failure/unwrapping: copied-source second-launch exception under both caller-flow modes drains the started worker, restores caller flow, rejects unpublished item and clears saved field. Task.Run(Func<Task>) tracks returned full WorkerAsync; completed placeholder slots retained.
- Measurements/AOT: earlier Task 4 timing predates fix. One 1016 B caller-thread constructor observation and zero worker count only; no throughput/cold-start gain inference. Task 10 owns final integrated A/B and actual consumer acceptance.

